    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A cup of coffee, a furry bear paw, and a hole in a gray wall. This was the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from the outside of a special coffee shop in Shanghai. The coffee shop, known as Hinichijou, made the headlines when it "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in 2020. It became famous not only for its unique service, but also for the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " story behind it. Hinichijou is actually a public "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "welfare",
            "zh": "公益"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " program. Its main "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is to provide meaningful job opportunities for people with "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "disabilities",
            "ref": "v-disability"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The wall was originally built to “protect” these workers, allowing them to work in a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " environment while still interacting with customers in a creative way."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the past few years, Hinichijou has "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " grown into a small coffee "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "chain",
            "ref": "v-chain"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". There are now more than ten shops across "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " cities in China. More than 60 per cent of the workers have hearing or "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "visual",
            "ref": "v-visual"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Interestingly, the walls, which were "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "symbolic",
            "ref": "v-symbolic"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "feature",
            "ref": "v-feature"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", have been removed since 2022. This change shows that the disabled workers have gained more "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and are no longer shy about meeting customers face to face. They now communicate more "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b11",
            "number": 11
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and warmly with the guests."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "On April 4, 2023, Hinichijou opened its first overseas shop in Singapore, marking an important step in its expansion. The shop has "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b12",
            "number": 12
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " two workers with "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "autism",
            "zh": "自闭症"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “They’re "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b13",
            "number": 13
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their work,” said manager Lee Swee Keng. “They really work hard and pay great attention to every "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b14",
            "number": 14
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ".” The Singapore branch aims to be more than just a coffee shop. “We hope that our shop will become a place in Singapore to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b15",
            "number": 15
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the idea of doing good and promote social inclusion,” Lee added."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
